;; Takes:     A, BC, DE, HL, IY
;; Leaves:    A, F, BC
;; Preserves: DE, HL (saved and restored)
;;
;; ? drives IN A,(HMPR), OUT (HMPR),A; calls SET_UP_WORK_AREA; falls into whatever follows rather than returning.
;; --------------------------------------------------------------------

; ---- COMPRESS_FILE_LOOP ---- from &6605 when A is not 0 yet
