;;     It was written here as PAGE_IN_ROM1, which is this half's own
;;     routine at &5C59 and nothing to do with it: the ROM's variable
;;     list marks &5C59-&5C60 "8 SPARE", and MasterBASIC uses them.
;;     
;;     What was here before:
;;     
